  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">STRENGTHENING CAPACITY OF PUBLIC SECTOR AUDIT INSTITUTIONS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will support the establishment of an institutional framework for external and internal audit, and  capacity building  of the Chamber of Accounts (CoA) and the Control and Revision Unit (CRU) of the Ministry of Finance. Specifically the grant will support the CoA to establish a legal framework for its external audit function, in line with international standards; increase transparency and disclosure of work and give staff the necessary skills to audit Government accounts. This project will cover internal audit primarily. TF055174 Capacity Building of Public Sector Audit Institutions with specific focus on Internal Audit</narrative>
  </description>
